<text name="atlas_oe_acid">Name: Acidic Origins
Type: Hostile (Nebula)
Unique: True
Dominant Faction: The Acidic Growth
Rebel Threat Level: Low
Locations of Interest: Central Acidic Shipyards
    
The Acidic Origins are a dangerous place, only the most extreme ships survive the Acidic nebula, and that isn't even considering trying to survive the Acidic ships themselves.</text>

<text name="ship_PLAYER_SHIP_OE_ACID_BILL_unlock">Consult the advice of a certain Acidic outcast about a certain artifact to unlock this ship.</text>

<text name="ship_PLAYER_SHIP_OE_ACID_ARTY_unlock">Help an Acidic outcast to unlock this ship.</text>
<text name="ship_PLAYER_SHIP_OE_ACID_ARTY_2_unlock">Get to Sector 5 with the Acidic Cruiser Type A to unlock this ship.</text>
<text name="ship_PLAYER_SHIP_OE_ACID_ARTY_3_unlock">Get to Sector 5 with the Acidic Cruiser Type B or beat the game with the Acidic Cruiser Type A to unlock this ship.</text>

<text name="ship_PLAYER_SHIP_OE_ACID_LONG_unlock">Find the central shipyards of the Acidic Growth to unlock this ship.</text>
<text name="ship_PLAYER_SHIP_OE_ACID_LONG_2_unlock">Get to Sector 5 with the Acidic Destroyer Type A to unlock this ship.</text>
<text name="ship_PLAYER_SHIP_OE_ACID_LONG_3_unlock">Get to Sector 5 with the Acidic Destroyer Type B or beat the game with the Acidic Destroyer Type A to unlock this ship.</text>
</FTL>
